{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]We [Eb/Bb]have [Cm]this [Db]hope [Eb]that [Cm]burns [Ab]within [Eb]hearts,
[Ab]Hope in the coming [Eb]of [Ab]the Lord.
[Bbm]We have [Fm/C]this faith [Bbm/Db]that [Fm]Christ alone [Bbm]imparts,
[Ab]Faith in [Eb/Bb]the promise [Db]of His [Eb7]Word.
[Cm]We believe [Eb]the time is [Ab]here,
[Bbm]When [Fm/C]the [Ab/Eb]nations [Eb7]far [Db/Ab]and [Ab]near
[Ab]Shall awake, [Eb]and shout, and sing
[Ab/Eb]Hallelujah! [Eb7]Christ [C7/E]is King!
[Fm]We [Ab/Eb]have this [Eb/Bb]hope that [Ab/C]burns [Eb/Bb]within our [Ab/C]hearts.
[Db]Hope in the [Ab]coming [Cm]of [Ab]the Lord.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]We are [Eb/Bb]united in Jesus [Ab]Christ [Eb]our Lord.
[Ab]We are united [Eb]in [Ab]His love.
[Bbm]Love for [Fm/C]the waiting people [Bbm]of the [Gdim]world,
[Ab]People [Eb/Bb]who need [Cm]our [Db]Savior's [Eb7]love.
[Cm]Soon the [Ab]heav'ns [Eb]will open [Ab]wide,
[Bbm]Christ [Fm/C]will [Ab/Eb]come [Eb]to [Eb7]claim [Db/Ab]His [Ab]bride,
[Ab]All the [Eb]universe will sing
[Ab/Eb]Hallelujah! [Eb7]Christ [C7/E]is King!
[Fm]We [Ab/Eb]have this [Eb/Bb]hope this [Ab/C]faith, [Eb/Bb]and [Ab]God's [Eb/Bb]great [Ab/C]love,
[Db]We are [Ab]united in Christ.
{end_of_verse}
